- MCP Apps: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/extensions/apps/overview
- MCP UI: https://github.com/MCP-UI-Org/mcp-ui
- App Bridge API: https://apps.extensions.modelcontextprotocol.io/api/modules/app-bridge.html
